<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77221" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰν-ᾰκής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all-healing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πάντων φάρμακον ἁ σοφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					47.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.455
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτάμιον π. πρὸς τὰς τῶν θρεμμάτων
					νόσους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					6.3.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπης πανακές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					154
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάνακες, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ους</span>,
					τό</span>, <i>all-heal,
				Ferulago galbanifera</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.7.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἀσκληπίειον</span>
			<i>Aesculapius' all-heal, Echinophora tenuifolia</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.8.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.11.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Ἡράκλειον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανάκεια</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.2a
			</span></i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.48
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Κενταύρειον</span>
			<i>Centaury, Centaurea salonitana</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				25.33
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				564
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λεπτόφυλλον</span>
			<i>feverfew, Erythraea Centaurium</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.11.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Χειρώνειον</span>
			<i>elecampane, Inula Helenium</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.11.1
			</span></i>; also, =
			<i>Chiron's all-heal, Hypericum olympicum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				565
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				500
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.95
			</span></i>.</div>
